# Build context for the production image (repository root).
#
# The context is the whole workspace because `next build` needs `packages/db`
# and `packages/ui` as source. Everything that cannot influence the build is
# excluded here so the daemon transfers kilobytes instead of gigabytes — most
# importantly `node_modules` from the host, which is platform-specific and would
# otherwise shadow the container's own install.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Python artifacts from a local scanner run
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv

# Version control and editor state
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vscode
.idea
.codegraph
.atl

# Documentation, specs and local infrastructure: none of it is imported by the
# build, and every megabyte here is one the daemon has to send.
docs
openspec
infra
**/*.md

# Secrets. Only the example file is allowed through.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
